      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vaydabber_adonai_el">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:vaydabber_adonai_el/1"/>And Adonoy spoke to Moses, saying,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:vaydabber_adonai_el/2"/>Speak to Aaron and to his sons, saying,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:vaydabber_adonai_el/3"/>thus shall you bless the Children of Israel,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:vaydabber_adonai_el/4"/>say to them:</tei:p>
